      "controls": {},
      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Each lane of the Step Sequencer is cabled into one Output's Show on A, so deck A cuts between three patches on the Master Gear's beat. Turn the Main Mixer's balance to A to watch the cuts, and click cells in the grid to move them. Cable a lane into a Show on B instead and the sequence cuts the other deck."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
    },
